  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ef3636c7249bae7aadcb25fbde49e58b6e3a343b_0.webp\" alt=\"Mizuno 更好的葉子\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">專為 Mizuno Craft 設計的材質包，讓樹木重現美麗，且完全不需要其他模組。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170452/description_dcf8ee24-159d-4bec-8c77-508866f2899e.png\" alt=\"更好的葉子\" width=\"381\" height=\"381\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170452/description_f96f5634-bc79-4576-b1ec-e6bfc9b708bd.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"294\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Leaves Flowers 2.0<br><br></strong></h3>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170452/description_67f42a60-ae3b-43d6-8e5f-75bf0998ce4e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"313\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170452/description_5429db39-a08d-41a7-88b7-dc03dd48550f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"312\"></p>\n<p><strong>模組支援：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiome-makeover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物群落改造</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">衆多生物群落</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">天界</a></li>\n<li style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fterrestria\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">大地</a></li>\n<li style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftraverse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">縱橫大陸</a></li>\n<li style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwilder-wild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">狂野荒野</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>我所有的 Mizuno 系列材質包。<br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno 更好的葉子</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">非官方 Mizuno 系列</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 連接紋理</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x Fresh Animations</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 深色模式</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 連接玻璃</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-eating-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 吃東西動畫</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-better-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 更好的草地</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><stron